{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$\\dfrac{x}{\\sin(x)}$ is the quotient of two, more basic, expressions: $x$ and $\\sin(x)$.\n\nTherefore, $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$ can be found using **the quotient rule**:\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\dfrac{u(x)}{v(x)}\\right]\u0026=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{d}{dx}[u(x)]v(x)-u(x)\\dfrac{d}{dx}[v(x)]}{[v(x)]^2}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{u'(x)v(x)-u(x)v'(x)}{[v(x)]^2}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's differentiate!\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left(\\dfrac{x}{\\sin(x)}\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{d}{dx}(x)\\sin(x)-x\\dfrac{d}{dx}(\\sin(x))}{(\\sin(x))^2}\u0026\u0026\\gray{\\text{The quotient rule}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1\\cdot \\sin(x)-x\\cdot \\cos(x)}{\\sin^2(x)}\u0026\u0026\\gray{\\text{Differentiate }x\\text{ and }\\sin(x)}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{\\sin(x)-x\\cos(x)}{\\sin^2(x)}\u0026\u0026\\gray{\\text{Simplify}}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion,\n\n$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{\\sin(x)-x\\cos(x)}{\\sin^2(x)}$\n\nor any other equivalent form.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Let $y=\\dfrac{x}{\\sin(x)}$.\n\n$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=$ [[☃ expression 1]]\n","images":{},"widgets":{"expression 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerForms":[{"considered":"correct","form":false,"key":0,"simplify":false,"value":"\\frac{\\sin\\left(x\\right)-x\\cos\\left(x\\right)}{\\sin^2\\left(x\\right)}"}],"buttonSets":["basic","trig","prealgebra"],"functions":["f","g","h"],"times":false},"static":false,"type":"expression","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
